 "description": "dePillis2008 - Optimal control of mixed immunotherapy and chemotherapy of tumors\nBioModels BIOMD0000000913 (curated). SBML file: dePillis2008.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 5 time units (SED-ML: dePillis2008.sedml), sampling 0.005.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 2.50e-06 of species peak (worst: I)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Elimination_of_tumor_by_the_action_of_immune_response term 3/3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): T1 = T; M1 = M",
